<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RTZ-CRA director retires.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RTZ-CRA director retires.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Australian mining group RTZ Corp Plc-CRA Ltd said on Thursday that director William Dix would retire today from the board of the company.</p>
<p>RTZ-CRA said Dix, 70, joined the Board of CRA in 1990 and was appointed chairman of CRA's audit committee in 1994.</p>
<p>He was appointed a director of the RTZ Corp Plc on implementation of the RTZ-CRA dual Listed companies merger in December 1995, RTZ-CRA said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
